  "method": "Edge 0 (NW face, 28 m on the NE diagonal) is the left side of D05 (cam (259.3,155.2), heading ~207): shops with grey roll-downs and open fronts under big beige retractable awnings at ~3.5-4 m, 2-3 m deep, behind a raised stone kerb/platform ~0.15 m high and ~1.2 m deep. Edges 2/4/5 (Muristan St) are the right side of E05: shops with goods under a green steel canopy on hoop brackets behind a raised step. 2 storeys with a long red-tile hipped roof (F01 middle; OSM roof:shape=hipped).",
